{"id":"n15134-1-7","stage":2,"title":"때때로 · 偶尔","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15134-1-7-1","ko":"요즘 너희 아버지께서 때때로 한숨을 쉬시던데.","zh":"最近看见你爸爸时不时叹气。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아버지께서","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때때로","meaning":"偶尔","explanation":"때때로：偶尔","readings":[{"term":"때때로","audio":"/audio/e6398d9ec31baa8fd5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15134","senseId":"1","lemma":"때때로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한숨을","meaning":"叹气","explanation":"한숨：叹气；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한숨","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72460","senseId":"1","lemma":"한숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬시던데.","meaning":"呼吸，喘","explanation":"쉬다：呼吸，喘；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62819","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"e6398d9ec31baa8f","term":"때때로","zh":"偶尔","audio":"/audio/e6398d9ec31baa8fd5fa.mp3","entryId":"15134","definition":"根据情况有时地。","pronunciation":["때때로"]},{"id":"3518247f7283983b","term":"한숨","zh":"叹气","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3","entryId":"72460","definition":"在忧愁或放松紧张的时候，呼出长气。","pronunciation":["한숨"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"呼吸，喘","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"62819","definition":"用鼻子或嘴吸入空气后再呼出。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b51618fc72262399c65.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15134-1-7-2","ko":"아버지께서 직장을 나오시게 되었거든.","zh":"因为他要离开原来的工作单位了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지께서","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직장을","meaning":"工作单位，职场","explanation":"직장：工作单位，职场；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58297","senseId":"1","lemma":"직장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나오시게","meaning":"离开，辞职","explanation":"나오다：离开，辞职；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"14","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었거든.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸",